<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The Salah application logo — the complete artwork from docs/artwork/salah_icon_full.svg:
  the deep-green rounded tile with the gold crescent, star and mihrab arch, converted to a
  density-independent vector.

  This is the single source of truth for the logo shown inside the app. It is read through
  painterResource(R.drawable.salah_brand_logo) by the shared Compose component
  `SalahBrandLogo` (core/designsystem/SalahBrandLogo.kt); no other screen draws its own copy.

  Unlike the launcher and splash layers this keeps the artwork exactly as authored (no
  adaptive-icon safe-zone scaling): nothing masks this resource, so the full tile shows.
-->
